{
 "name": "tiger_ye_yaohuo",
 "_variant": "V-C 妖火虎。2026-09-04 回修檢視卷：依 docs/experiments/2026-09-04-ref-tiger.md 的真實虎爺神像五條特徵回修（橘金布罩＋黑渦漩紋＋白毛邊＋深臉白獠牙＋紅綬帶＋蹲踞低伏），妖火語彙（火鬃／尾火／eye／mouth_glow）保留為『被供奉而燃燒』。基底＝assets/creatures/tiger.json，不動原檔。",
 "_paw_note": "buildPaw 的預設 offset 會把腳掌吸到地面（sole on ground）；抬起來的掌必須自己給 offset，否則掌會掉到 y=0.045 跟小腿脫節（part_attachment BLOCK 0.163）。本回修版四掌全部落地蹲踞，沒有抬起的掌。",
 "_brief": "Tiger Lord (虎爺) enshrined under the altar table: a deep crouch, forelegs stretched flat on the ground, chest low. Body wrapped in an orange-gold votive cloth edged with gold braid and a shaggy white fur trim; black curled-cloud whorls painted over the cloth. Dark lacquered face, jaw wrenched wide with paired white fangs, red silk sash hanging at the throat. Ghost-fire still burns along the spine and tail tip and inside the maw — it is a god that has been fed incense until it caught fire. Feel: solemn AND fierce — a thing you kowtow to. Signature = the wide-open glowing maw. Identity view = side.",
 "_exaggeration_vs_anchor": "wolf anchor W/H 1.41 -> ~2.0 (crouched, long and very low); leg_fraction 0.35 -> ~0.20 (folded, belly near the ground); the fur-trim tufts + fire ridge + tail flames push the silhouette's turn_count up so it never reads as a smooth toy.",
 "_glow_materials": "eye / mouth_glow / glow_tail / glow_mane —— 命名是給 three.js 端用的：L 卷會把這些材質名接成 emissive，bloom 才吃得到。這份 spec 本身只把它們塗成高亮高飽和色。",
 "_ref_map": "ref 特徵 → 本檔落點：①蹲踞低伏＝Hips y 0.40＋四掌落地＋前肢前伸；②橘金布罩＋黑渦漩紋＝fur_body #d98a24＋body arcs（脊黑／金滾邊／白毛邊／腹黑）＋8 對 stripe 捲雲板（一大一小成對、逐組換傾角）；③白毛邊＝arcs 香灰白帶＋5 對 trim 毛簇 curve（剪影上蓬鬆）；④深臉白獠牙＝fur_head #2e2b2a＋fang 四支＋大張口；⑤紅綬帶＝sash 垂墜 fin 兩對（聖經 §1 垂墜物）。",
